iv><div class="w-full aspect-square bg-white/10 rounded-[3rem] overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-[12px] border-white/20 relative"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367734/eurocert/Gemini_Generated_Image_peu3vqpeu3vqpeu3_1_.png.png" alt="Electrical safety audit team inspecting control panel" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-slate-900/40 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-14 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">About Electrical Safety Audit</h2><p class="text-slate-600 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">Electrical Safety Audit is a systematic evaluation of electrical systems, installations, and practices to identify hazards, ensure compliance with safety standards, and reduce risks such as electrical fires, shocks, and equipment failures.</p><p class="heading-font text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-euro-700 font-bold mb-4">Our audit helps organizations:</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Detect hidden electrical risks</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Improve system reliability</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Ensure legal compliance</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-[#f8fafc] px-4 py-3"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-euro-600"></i><span class="text-slate-700 font-medium">Enhance workplace safety</span></div></div></div><div class="w-full rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100 lg:col-span-7"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367595/eurocert/oooo.webp.webp" alt="Electrical auditor performing safety checks" class="block w-full h-auto" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-[#030a16] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.12)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="relative z-10 text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10"><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Electrical Safety Audit is Important</h2></div><div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-10"><div class="rounded-3xl border-4 border-eurogold-400 shadow-[0_0_0_2px_rgba(212,168,67,0.25),0_0_40px_rgba(212,168,67,0.2)] overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><video class="w-full aspect-video block bg-black" autoPlay="" loop="" muted="" playsInline="" preload="metadata" controls="" poster="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367595/eurocert/oooo.webp.webp"><source src="/Electrical_Safety_Audit_Video_Ready.mp4" type="video/mp4"/>Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></div></div><div class="relative z-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="rounded-3xl border border-red-500/30 bg-red-500/10 p-8"><h3 class="heading-font text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-5">Electrical failures are one of the leading causes of:</h3><div class="space-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-white/85"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation text-red-500"></i><span class="font-medium">Industrial fires</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-whit