aged insulation</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Overheating panels</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-eurogold-400 shrink-0">•<span>Poor cable management</span></li></ul></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/45 font-bold mb-2">Solution Provided</h4><ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80"><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Wiring replacement</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Panel upgrades</span></li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fas fa-wrench text-eurogold-400/80 text-xs mt-1 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Structured cable layout</span></li></ul></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-green-500/25 bg-green-500/10 px-5 py-4"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-green-400/90 font-bold mb-3">Result</h4><ul class="space-y-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Eliminated fire hazards</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Compliance with safety standards</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-white/90 font-medium"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-green-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Increased system reliability</span></li></ul></div></div></article></div></div></section><section class="py-24 bg-[#f8fafc] border-t border-slate-200/80"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-12"><h2 class="heading-font text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Our 5-Step Audit Process</h2></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-8"><div class="bg-white p-8